@startuml
title Model agent communication behavior for broadcast, multicast, and unicast messaging, including optional encryption/decryption and multicast group join/leave notifications.

start

if (Select communication type) then (Unicast)
:Send unicast message to another agent;
elseif (Select communication type) then (Multicast)
:Send multicast message to the group;
elseif (Select communication type) then (Broadcast)
:Send message to everyone in the same local network;
elseif (Select communication type) then (Join multicast group)
:Join multicast group;
:Send notify to join multicast group;
stop
else (Leave multicast group)
:Leave multicast group;
:Send notify to leave multicast group;
stop
endif
if (Encrypt message?) then (Encrypted)
:Provide message encryption techniques;
else (Not encrypted)
endif
:Another agent receives message;
if (Another agent receives message) then (Unicast or Multicast)
:Provide message decryption techniques;
else (Broadcast)
endif
stop

@enduml